{"seq":5,"slug":"lc0349-intersection-of-two-arrays","title":"LeetCode 349 两个数组的交集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0349-intersection-of-two-arrays","wordCount":849,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-349-两个数组的交集\">LeetCode 349 两个数组的交集</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定两个整数数组 <code>nums1</code> 和 <code>nums2</code>，返回它们的<strong>交集</strong>。输出结果中的每个元素一定是<strong>唯一</strong>的，可以不考虑输出结果的顺序。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums1.length, nums2.length &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n<li><code>0 &lt;= nums1[i], nums2[i] &lt;= 1000</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums1 = [1, 2, 2, 1], nums2 = [2, 2]&#10;输出：[2]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums1 = [1, 2, 2, 1], nums2 = [2, 2]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[2]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums1 = [4, 9, 5], nums2 = [9, 4, 9, 8, 4]&#10;输出：[9, 4]&#10;解释：[4, 9] 也是可以接受的\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums1 = [4, 9, 5], nums2 = [9, 4, 9, 8, 4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[9, 4]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：[4, 9] 也是可以接受的</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题考察的是集合运算中最基本的<strong>交集</strong>操作。我们将通过此题理解哈希集合在集合运算中的核心作用，以及排序 + 双指针作为替代方案的适用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><h3 id=\"集合交集的数学定义\">集合交集的数学定义</h3><p>集合 A 与集合 B 的交集定义为：<code>A ∩ B = { x | x ∈ A 且 x ∈ B }</code>。在编程中，这意味着我们需要找出同时存在于两个数组中的元素，并去重。</p>\n<h3 id=\"方法一-哈希集合\">方法一：哈希集合</h3><p>最直觉的方法是将 <code>nums1</code> 转为 Set，然后遍历 <code>nums2</code>，检查每个元素是否在 Set 中。为了避免重复输出，结果也用 Set 存储。</p>\n<p>核心步骤：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>将 <code>nums1</code> 所有元素放入 <code>set1</code></li>\n<li>遍历 <code>nums2</code>，如果元素在 <code>set1</code> 中，则加入结果 Set</li>\n<li>将结果 Set 转为数组返回</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"方法二-排序-双指针\">方法二：排序 + 双指针</h3><p>先将两个数组分别排序，然后用两个指针同时从左到右扫描：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>nums1[i] &lt; nums2[j]</code>，移动 <code>i</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums1[i] &gt; nums2[j]</code>，移动 <code>j</code></li>\n<li>如果相等，将该元素加入结果（注意去重），同时移动 <code>i</code> 和 <code>j</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"方法三-javascript-set-内置操作\">方法三：JavaScript Set 内置操作</h3><p>在 ES2025 中，<code>Set</code> 新增了 <code>intersection()</code> 方法，可以直接计算交集。虽然面试中通常需要手动实现，但了解标准库的能力有助于实际工程开发。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希集合</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(m)</td>\n<td>最快，代码简洁</td>\n<td>额外空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序 + 双指针</td>\n<td>O(m log m + n log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)*</td>\n<td>空间节省</td>\n<td>需排序</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set.intersection()</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(min(m,n))</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>兼容性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>其中 m 和 n 分别为两个数组的长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><h3 id=\"哈希集合法-推荐\">哈希集合法（推荐）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function intersection(nums1: number[], nums2: number[]): number[] {&#10;  const set1 = new Set(nums1);&#10;  const result = new Set&lt;number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums2) {&#10;    if (set1.has(num)) {&#10;      result.add(num);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return [...result];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intersection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (set1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"排序-双指针法\">排序 + 双指针法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function intersection(nums1: number[], nums2: number[]): number[] {&#10;  nums1.sort((a, b) =&gt; a - b);&#10;  nums2.sort((a, b) =&gt; a - b);&#10;&#10;  const result: number[] = [];&#10;  let i = 0;&#10;  let j = 0;&#10;&#10;  while (i &lt; nums1.length &amp;&amp; j &lt; nums2.length) {&#10;    if (nums1[i] &lt; nums2[j]) {&#10;      i++;&#10;    } else if (nums1[i] &gt; nums2[j]) {&#10;      j++;&#10;    } else {&#10;      if (result.length === 0 || result[result.length - 1] !== nums1[i]) {&#10;        result.push(nums1[i]);&#10;      }&#10;      i++;&#10;      j++;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intersection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nums1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  nums2.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums1[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2[j]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums1[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2[j]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ===</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result[result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums1[i]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums1[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      j</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>执行过程示例：</strong></p>\n<p>以 <code>nums1 = [4, 9, 5]</code>、<code>nums2 = [9, 4, 9, 8, 4]</code> 为例（哈希集合法）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>set1</th>\n<th>result</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始化</td>\n<td>构建 set1</td>\n<td>{4, 9, 5}</td>\n<td>{}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>检查 9</td>\n<td>{4, 9, 5}</td>\n<td>{9}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>检查 4</td>\n<td>{4, 9, 5}</td>\n<td>{9, 4}</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>检查 9</td>\n<td>{4, 9, 5}</td>\n<td>{9, 4}（已存在）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>检查 8</td>\n<td>{4, 9, 5}</td>\n<td>{9, 4}（不在 set1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>检查 4</td>\n<td>{4, 9, 5}</td>\n<td>{9, 4}（已存在）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最终返回 <code>[9, 4]</code>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"优化-选择较小数组建-set\">优化：选择较小数组建 Set</h3><p>当两个数组大小差异较大时，用较小的数组建 Set 能节省空间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function intersection(nums1: number[], nums2: number[]): number[] {&#10;  if (nums1.length &gt; nums2.length) {&#10;    return intersection(nums2, nums1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const set1 = new Set(nums1);&#10;  const result = new Set&lt;number&gt;();&#10;&#10;  for (const num of nums2) {&#10;    if (set1.has(num)) {&#10;      result.add(num);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return [...result];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intersection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> intersection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums2, nums1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> set1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(nums1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> num</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (set1.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(num);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">...</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>哈希集合</td>\n<td>O(m + n)</td>\n<td>O(min(m, n))</td>\n<td>用较小数组建 Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序 + 双指针</td>\n<td>O(m log m + n log n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>不计排序的栈空间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度分析：</strong> 哈希集合法中，构建 Set 的时间为 O(m)，遍历第二个数组为 O(n)，每次 <code>has</code> 操作为 O(1)，总时间 O(m + n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度分析：</strong> 使用优化版本，始终用较小数组建 Set，空间为 O(min(m, n))。结果数组的空间不计入额外空间（视为输出空间）。</p>\n<p><strong>扩展思考：</strong> 如果题目改为求交集中每个元素出现的最少次数（即 LC #350 两个数组的交集 II），就需要将 Set 换为 Map 来记录频次。这体现了从「存在性查询」到「频次统计」的演进，是哈希表系列问题中的核心递进路线。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 349 两个数组的交集","id":"leetcode-349-两个数组的交集"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"集合交集的数学定义","id":"集合交集的数学定义"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：哈希集合","id":"方法一-哈希集合"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：排序 + 双指针","id":"方法二-排序-双指针"},{"level":3,"text":"方法三：JavaScript Set 内置操作","id":"方法三-javascript-set-内置操作"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"哈希集合法（推荐）","id":"哈希集合法-推荐"},{"level":3,"text":"排序 + 双指针法","id":"排序-双指针法"},{"level":3,"text":"优化：选择较小数组建 Set","id":"优化-选择较小数组建-set"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 242 有效的字母异位词","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0242-valid-anagram"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 94 二叉树的中序遍历","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/easy-hash-tree-math/lc0094-binary-tree-inorder"}}